================================================================================
Note: the MIT license above covers only this project's **code** (`src/`, `build/`, `tools/`, `tests/`).

The **art assets below are not original to this project**, are not covered by the MIT
license, and must not be used commercially:

  · cursors/                  Crystal cursor art, from the third-party cursor scheme "PRTS Replica v8 96x"
  · src/arkmouse/art.bin      Same as above (packed frame data)
  · src/arkmouse/fx.bin       Frames for the click squeeze / drag claw / idle animations, same as above

Origin: this machine's `%LOCALAPPDATA%\PRTS\Replica-v8-Windows\cursors-34497b84e5b0d7cf\`
(1010 .cur files + 396 .ani files), deployed by the third-party installer PRTS-Motion-96.exe.

**This art is not in the Arknights game client data** — the project did an exhaustive
cross-check: normalizing all 1022 textures ≥20px in the entire game into 48×48
silhouettes and computing IoU against the crystal cursor, the highest in the whole game
is only 0.574 (and it's an unrelated UI piece); the 3 arrows shipped with the game are
only 0.548 / 0.546 / 0.545.
The "Replica" in the name means 复刻 (replica) — a third-party imitation made in the game's style.

This project does only one thing: "get existing cursors installed into Windows". It claims
no rights over the art, and does not modify any game files. If you are a rights holder and
want it taken down, please file an issue and it will be handled immediately.
